WEBVTT

NOTE Fictional focus group for the Trama manual. Everyone here is invented.

1
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:11.900
<v Moderator>Thank you all for coming. What has changed at the garden since last year?</v>

2
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:21.300
<v Joan>The waiting list, mostly. It used to be a few months. Now people wait two years for a plot.</v>

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.800
<v Kwame>And the new flats behind the fence. Some of them come over just to sit. I don't mind that.</v>

4
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:38.400
<v Joan>I don't mind it either, as long as they don't help themselves to the raspberries. [laughter]</v>

5
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:47.700
<v Moderator>Does the committee talk about the people waiting?</v>

6
00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:59.000
<v Priya>Every meeting. We started shared beds so people on the list can grow something while they wait. Half a bed is better than nothing.</v>

7
00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:08.200
<v Kwame>It's how I started. Half a bed of onions and a lot of advice I didn't ask for.</v>
